LUMA SUMMARY:
Public-repo milestone. Cozmo verifies that the live GitHub archive is actually visible, asks the crew what they can see, and realizes the archive can act as a public proof trail. The session reinforces “show, don't tell,” separates the public archive from future private QS sessions, and ends with the operational rule not to work on the live engine while it is running.
